    Bug 1960750 - Add a pref to trigger the Account Hub Address Book step when triggering any create address book action. r=freaktechnik


    **How to Test**
    - Switch the accounthub.addressbook.enabled pref to true
    - The app menu should no longer show indicator for opening a submenu when trying to create an address book
    - In the address book tab, clicking create new address book should open the account hub dialog
    - When clicking create new address book in the app menu, it should open the account hub dialog
    - Switching the preference back should return those buttons to their default state

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D247128

